<view class="demo">流程体验版 · 提交预订现在无需付款</view><view class="page"><view class="title">留下一份甜蜜预订</view><view class="subtitle">由店员确认档期，把这份心意安排妥当。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{product}}"><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">联系与交付</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系人</text><input value="{{contactName}}" data-field="contactName" bindinput="input" maxlength="30" placeholder="怎么称呼你"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><input value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="方便店员联系你"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交付方式</text><picker range="{{fulfillmentLabels}}" value="{{fulfillmentIndex}}" bindchange="fulfillment"><view class="picker">{{fulfillmentLabels[fulfillmentIndex]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{fulfillment === 'delivery'}}" class="field"><text class="field-label">配送地址</text><textarea value="{{address}}" data-field="address" bindinput="input" maxlength="200" placeholder="详细地址，店员会确认是否可以送达"/></view><view class="pair"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交付日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{minDate}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交付时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" start="{{openTime}}" end="{{closeTime}}" bindchange="time"><view class="picker">{{time}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">蛋糕祝福语（选填）</text><input value="{{message}}" data-field="message" bindinput="input" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：生日快乐，每天都甜甜的"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">其他备注（选填）</text><textarea value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="200"/></view><view class="small muted">营业时间 {{openTime}}–{{closeTime}}；具体交付时间需店员确认。</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="product-line"><view class="thumb"><cake-art theme="{{product.theme}}"/></view><view><view class="name">{{product.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{size}} / {{flavor}}</view></view></view><view class="row"><text>蛋糕金额</text><text>¥{{totalYuan}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>配送费</text><text>免费</text></view><view class="row divider"><text>确认后付定金 · 30%</text><text class="price">¥{{depositYuan}}</text></view><view class="row small muted"><text>交付时付尾款</text><text>¥{{balanceYuan}}</text></view><view class="info">{{policy}}</view><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交预订</button></view></block></view>
